<title>USA: Clinton names IRS review panel.</title>
<headline>Clinton names IRS review panel.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Clinton Tuesday issued an executive order creating a review board to ensure effective management of the Internal Revenue Service.</p>
<p>The board, which will have at least 20 members, will deal with a broad range of IRS functions &quot;particularly those that have a significant impact on operations, modernisation and customer service,&quot; the White House said.</p>
</text>
